{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/CAUSE_BAR_E.png?t=1743991464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Mushroom Island, a place to relax and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/GIF_MUSHROOM_WIND.gif?t=1743991464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/GIF_MUSHROOM_COW.gif?t=1743991464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/BUILD_BAR_E.png?t=1743991464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompanied by soothing music, you are free to build the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/GIF_MUSHROOM_BUILD.gif?t=1743991464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Easy to learn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Original fantasy world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Colorful, vivid HD graphics and animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Free to build the island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Hire workers to work for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Automate your workflow to increase your idle income</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Build your dream city on a deserted island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010More\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And..... more to come</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332040?t=1743991464","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332040?t=1743991464","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati